comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-27T10:40:49.479Z",codex-agent,"Read-only baseline proof: extracted tracked .agents/pm from main 09d45956761b0547d955258b59d63103168c217c into a plain scratch tracker and ran the repository-pinned pm --no-extensions health --full --json. It reports the identical advisory provenance_value_domain_invalid:claude-code:role:single_digit:23 as this branch, with no new structural failures. This item stays open for owner review. No history-repair, normalization, dependency-floor change or historical rewrite is performed."
